  "title": "Songhai Empire",
  "summary": "The Songhai Empire grew from a kingdom on the Niger bend into the largest state in West Africa, with Gao as its capital according to World History Encyclopedia. Sunni Ali (r. 1464-1492) began conquest, and Askia Mohammad I (r. 1494-1528) promoted Islamic law and scholarship. Civil wars weakened it, and Moroccan musket-armed forces defeated it in 1590-1591.",
